@103751 = ~^AMultiple howls echo in response from all directions.^-~
@103752 = ~^AThe wild remains silent to your summons.^-~
@103753 = ~^AYour howl echoes, but nothing answers.^-~
@103754 = ~^AYour howl fades into the forest, unanswered.^-~
@103755 = ~^AYour call is answered by the sound of distant howls.^-~
@103756 = ~^AA pair of hunting wolves is closing in on your side.^-~
@103757 = ~^AAs your howl fades away, no shapes stir in the distance.^-~
@103758 = ~Your bones snap and reform as the Beastlord's hunger takes hold...~
@103759 = ~The scent of marrow fills your senses. The hunt begins!~
@103760 = ~Reason flees before the rising tide of the blood-urge.~
@103761 = ~The human shell tears away. The Beast is unleashed.~
@103762 = ~The Moon's curse boils within; hunger overtakes you.~
@103763 = ~The crimson veil lifts, leaving only the ache of broken bone.~
@103764 = ~The fever breaks. You find yourself human once more.~
@103765 = ~The Beast retreats to the shadows of your mind. You are whole again.~
@103766 = ~The blood cools. The frenzy subsides.~
@103767 = ~Malar's favor wanes as the red mist clears from your eyes.~
@103768 = ~Thick-Skinned~
@103769 = ~Thick-Skinned
The were-warrior’s body grows unnaturally dense and resistant to harm. Muscles knot, bone thickens, and the skin takes on a near-armored resilience. With each selection of this ability, the character becomes increasingly impervious to physical assault.

Effect:  
  +5% Slashing Resistance  
  +5% Piercing Resistance  
  +5% Crushing Resistance  
  +5% Missile Resistance

May be chosen up to two times.
~
